    {
      "id": "HN-ING-11-2026-W25-repaso-p3-001-MASTERY-bundle-v1",
      "statement": "Silvia said: \"I visited the ruins last year.\" Which is the correct reported speech form?",
      "context": "Silvia is talking about her visit to the Copan Ruins last summer.",
      "options": [
        {
          "letter": "A",
          "text": "Silvia said she visits the ruins last year.",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrecto. Silvia said she visits the ruins last ye"
        },
        {
          "letter": "B",
          "text": "Silvia said she had visited the ruins the previous year.",
          "is_correct": true,
          "feedback": "Correcto! Silvia said she had visited the ruins the previous year."
        },
        {
          "letter": "C",
          "text": "Silvia said she has visited the ruins last year.",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrecto. Silvia said she has visited the ruins la"
        },
        {
          "letter": "D",
          "text": "Silvia said she would visit the ruins the previous year.",
          "is_correct": false,
          "feedback": "Incorrecto. Silvia said she would visit the ruins th"
        }
      ],
      "correct_answer": "B",
      "explanation": "En el estilo indirecto (reported speech), cuando el verbo introductorio está en pasado, el Past Simple de la oración original debe cambiar a Past Perfect. Además, las expresiones de tiempo como 'last year' cambian a 'the previous year' o 'the year before'.\n\n---",
      "difficulty": "3",
